infographic compare-binary-horizontal-underline-text-vs
data
  title Move the boundary, move the bundle
  desc Same dashboard — 'use client' on the layout vs on the leaf ThemeToggle
  compares
    - label Boundary on the layout
      children
        - label Adds 180KB of client JS
          desc The whole import subtree downloads
        - label 90KB table library ships
          desc Plus every chart and formatter
        - label date-fns locale + analytics SDK
          desc Dragged in via transitive imports
        - label DB query must leave the server
          desc Back to the fetch-then-render waterfall
    - label Boundary on the leaf
      children
        - label Only the toggle's closure ships
          desc A few hundred bytes
        - label Layout + sidebar stay server-only
          desc Rendered into the RSC payload
        - label DB query stays co-located
          desc ~1ms server hop, no client fetch
        - label Charts + formatters cost zero JS
          desc Their code never enters the client graph
theme
  palette #f43f5e #14b8a6
